<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Smith's Food cut to neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Smith's Food cut to neutral.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it cut its rating of Smith's Food &amp; Drug Centers Inc to neutral from outperform.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1/4 to 44-1/4 and touched a new high of 44-3/8 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- The company announced it would be acquired by Fred Meyer Inc on Monday in a $2 billion deal that gives Smith's shareholders 1.05 shares of Fred Meyer common stock.</p>
</text>
